  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can channel lunar magic when you take a Wild Shape form, gaining the following benefits.</p><p><strong>Challenge Rating.</strong> The maximum Challenge Rating of the form equals your Druid level divided by 3 (round down).</p><p><strong>Armor Class.</strong> Until you leave the form, your AC equals 13 plus your Wisdom modifier if that total is higher than the Beast's AC.</p><p><strong>Temporary Hit Points.</strong> You gain Temporary Hit Points equal to three times your Druid level.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-k12KrzZXvSRCZHmS\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Set the form's AC to 13 + your Wisdom modifier if it is higher (minimum AC of the transformation).</p></section>",
